// P3E.2 (test-drive.md TD5.4, X6; essential-tips.md T1.2, X1; external-references.md ER7.7):
// the full Tab manager. "Exercise: Move to Document" (`move-doc setup`: Hexapod, Pneumatic
// Piston, Piston Assembly, Topplate, Baseplate) with "Drawing 1" (`move-doc drawing`).
// 01 the Tab manager (the tab bar's leftmost icon), docked at the left, full height, pushing the
//    toolbar and the instance list right: two-line rows (thumbnail, name, type in grey italic),
//    the active Hexapod light blue with a dark-blue bar and bold; Sort, Search tabs, the type
//    toggles and Clear, New folder, the count; the preview of the active tab at the bottom.
// 02 search "plate": Topplate and Baseplate ("2 of 6 tabs").
// 03 search cleared, the Assemblies filter (a toggle): Hexapod and Piston Assembly.
// 04 the Drawings filter: Drawing 1; the panel keeps its height.
// 05 Clear; Topplate clicked and Baseplate Ctrl+clicked; New folder hovered.
// 06 New folder: "Folder 1" holds them, renamed in place in its row ("Plates" typed).
// 07 the list: "Plates" ("Folder · 2 tabs") as an open folder row with Topplate and Baseplate
//    indented; the tab bar shows the folder tab.
// 08 Drawing 1 dragged onto the Plates row: a blue box round it and the row's ghost.
// 09 dropped: Plates ("Folder · 3 tabs"), Drawing 1 in it.
// 10 Hexapod dragged to just above Plates: the blue drop line.
// 11 dropped: Pneumatic Piston, Piston Assembly, Hexapod, Plates; the tab bar in the same order.
// 11b Sort ▾ → Name A–Z: the tabs flat by name, with their folder ("· in Plates"); then Clear.
// 12 the Plates row clicked: closed (a right chevron).
// 13 the folder row's menu: Move 3 tabs to document…, New folder from selection, Open in tab
//    bar, Rename…, Delete folder…; the first hovered.
// 14 Move 3 tabs to document… (P3G.3): the dialog lists the folder's three tabs (details shown);
//    the new document is named "Plates" after the folder.
// 15 cancelled; Ctrl+Z: the reorder undone in one step (Hexapod first again).
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("move-doc setup"),
        Wait(90),
        Custom("move-doc drawing"),
        Wait(40),
        Click(ui("tab-hexapod")),
        Wait(30),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        Click(ui("tab-manager")),
        WaitFor("tab-manager-row-6"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-tab-manager"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-search")),
        Wait(3),
        Type("plate"),
        Wait(10),
        ExpectText("tab-manager-count", "2 of 6 tabs"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-search-plate"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-search")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Key("Backspace"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-filter-assemblies")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-filter-assemblies"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-filter-drawings")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-filter-drawings"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-clear")),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-row-4")),
        Wait(10),
        KeyDown("Ctrl"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-row-5")),
        KeyUp("Ctrl"),
        Wait(10),
        Hover(ui("tab-manager-new-folder")),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("05-two-selected-new-folder"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-new-folder")),
        WaitFor("tab-manager-folder-rename-field"),
        Wait(10),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("Plates"),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-folder-renaming"),
        Key("Enter"),
        WaitFor("tab-manager-folder-plates"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-folder-row"),
        Press(ui("tab-manager-row-6")),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(ui_at("tab-manager-row-6", 0.4, 0.3)),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(ui_at("tab-manager-folder-plates", 0.45, 0.5)),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(ui_at("tab-manager-folder-plates", 0.5, 0.5)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("08-drag-onto-folder"),
        Release,
        Wait(20),
        ExpectText("tab-manager-folder-plates", "3 tabs"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("09-dropped-in-folder"),
        Press(ui("tab-manager-row-1")),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(ui_at("tab-manager-row-1", 0.4, 0.8)),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(ui_at("tab-manager-folder-plates", 0.5, 0.12)),
        Wait(2),
        Hover(ui_at("tab-manager-folder-plates", 0.5, 0.1)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("10-drag-reorder-line"),
        Release,
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11-reordered"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-sort")),
        WaitFor("tab-manager-sort-menu"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-sort-name-asc")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("11b-sorted-by-name"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-clear")),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-folder-plates")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-folder-closed"),
        RightClick(ui("tab-manager-folder-plates")),
        WaitFor("tab-manager-menu"),
        Wait(5),
        Hover(ui("tab-manager-menu-move")),
        Wait(20),
        Screenshot("13-folder-row-menu"),
        Click(ui("tab-manager-menu-move")),
        WaitFor("move-to-document-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("move-details")),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("14-move-folder-to-document"),
        Click(ui("move-cancel")),
        Wait(10),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        Wait(20),
        // P3E.3a: the manager stayed open, docked, under the dialog.
        WaitFor("tab-manager-panel"),
        Wait(10),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("15-undo-reorder"),
    ],
)
